    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Monday morning sees many workers in Pakistan's spinning and weaving factories complain of chest pain and shortness of breath. Commonly known as 'Monday fever', these symptoms are actually signs of respiratory disease which resurface as employees return to work and become exposed to cotton dust.",
